      "id": "P7-D01",
      "path": "src/desktop/apta_posix_file.c",
      "statement": "The parent directory is not fsync()'d after rename(). Atomic visibility and temporary-file cleanup are preserved, but metadata durability across sudden power loss is not guaranteed.",
      "classification": "documented crash-durability limitation; not a parser memory-safety defect"
